OL,3,ARussell Brand told police he never had
OL,4,Anon-consensual sex
OL,5,
OL,6,FWarning - this report contains graphic
OL,7,Fcontent
OL,9,FRussell Brand told police in interviews
OL,10,Fin response to allegations of rape and
OL,11,Fsexual assault that he had been "very
OL,12,Fpromiscuous" in the past, but had never
OL,13,Fengaged in "non-consensual sexual
OL,14,Factivity", a court has heard.
OL,16,FBrand, 51, was interviewed four times
OL,17,Fbetween 2023 and 2025 by officers.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
